#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:sale.order.template,note:industry_lawyer.sale_order_template_1
msgid ""
"SCOPE OF ENGAGEMENT\n"
"The Client engages the Attorney to provide legal counsel and/or court "
"representation. The Attorney commits to implementing all necessary means to "
"best defend the Client's interests."
msgstr ""
"ESCOPO DO CONTRATO\n"
"O Cliente contrata o Advogado para prestar assessoria jurídica e/ou "
"representação judicial. O Advogado se compromete a implementar todos os "
"meios necessários para melhor defender os interesses do Cliente."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.welcome_article_body
